{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわぁ．まにだよ？ろってぃだよ。\n皆さん, おつかれさまぁぁぁ♡.＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆今日も元気ですかぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は最近,本当に充実しています(o^^o)\n早く皆さんにお知らせしたい事がいくつかあるんだけどねっ,,, まだ言えないのぉ～♡\nお口はミッフィーちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日曜は,横浜にて個別握手会でした．\nではさっそくですが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のまに私服です.＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/06/10/6596192/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帽子,,,渋谷の帽子屋さん\nトップス,,,GU\nデニム,アクセサリー,,,OZOC\nベルト,,,H&M\nヒール,,,EMODA  だよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アクセとベルトはゴールドで合わしました.＊\n左の手首に,シルバーとグリーンのアクセつけてます．光でとんどるね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも女性の方々が,「いつもろってぃーの私服参考にしてるよぉ♡」って言ってもらえることが嬉しいです☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も又,ろってぃーレーンは最高に楽しかったです.＊   皆ありがとう（＾ω＾）\n沢山楽しませてもらいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近,この3人で写真撮ってなかったので撮ったよぉ～ん．"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/06/10/6596192/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ口したの．笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/06/10/6596192/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい仲間.＊"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/06/10/6596192/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全身"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/06/10/6596192/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はらりんとじゅんなと,とある練習をしてきまして,  その後にちょびっとレコーディングをしてきました＠ 'ェ' ＠♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日もお仕事 楽しくポジティブに頑張りまぁ～す.＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆 だいすきっ."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほなお風呂入ってきましすねぇぇ\nまたねぇ(^O^)ノ"}],"source":"archive"}